  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective for this operation is to increase sustainable access to formal grid-based electricity services within Vanuatu&#x2019;s electricity concession service areas for low income consumers through targeted subsidies.</narrative>
  </description>
